      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im trying to get into the science side of sourdough more. i get that yeast and bacteria are in there, but since they're microscopic and basically working away in the dark inside the dough, it's hard to visualize. can u explain the actual biological process of how they metabolize the starches and what's actually happening in that hidden environment to make the dough change?",
